              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunoo, dhiigni isaa Iddoo Qulqulluutti ol hin galfamne; isin akkuma ani ajajetti reʼee sana naannoo Iddoo Qulqulluutti nyaachuu qabdu ture.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
